{"unit_id":"lordship12138-crypto__dsh-plugin-dedup#feature-1","repo":"lordship12138-crypto/dsh-plugin-dedup","commit":"211055668e43c78016810426ae8bbad851c7434d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-dedup 的功能「相似度审查」：比较不同插件包的源码 token 相似度、包含度及名称用途相似度，并为每对包标出重复、重叠或无关等结果。通过 review 操作提交描述符后即可获得配对报告。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:126-164"]}
